# Pull request description

When creating or editing a GitHub PR for this repository:

1. Read `.github/pull_request_template.md` and fill every section in your own words.
2. Follow `.agents/skills/write-pr-description/SKILL.md` (vendored in this repo).
3. Open or update the PR with `.agents/skills/create-pr/SKILL.md`.

Do **not** use the old Specification / Verification checklist layout unless the user explicitly asks.

Keep sections: **Description**, **Why are these changes needed?**, **Key Changes**, **How to Test**, **Media (If UI changes)**.

For Maven verification, use `./mvnw clean verify` (not npm). Omit screenshots when there is no UI; link diagrams or curl docs instead.
